-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><b><a href=\"/page/Necropolis\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Necropolis\">Necropolis</a></b>, Turn in <a href=\"/page/Named_quest_rewards#Eerie_Scarab_Powder\" title=\"Named quest rewards\">Eerie Scarab Powder</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Undead_Guard\" title=\"Undead Guard\">Undead&#32;Guard</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Undead_Guard\" title=\"Undead Guard\">Undead&#32;Guard</a>:</b> This armor burns those Undead that attack the wearer, causing 3d8 Good damage on a successful melee attack.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Faith_(enchantment)\" title=\"Faith (enchantment)\">Faith</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Faith_(enchantment)\" title=\"Faith (enchantment)\">Faith</a>:</b> Holy power infuses this item, providing <a href=\"/page/Damage_reduction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage reduction\">damage reduction</a> 5/evil.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Kaelth%27s_Touch.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Kaelth%27s_Touch.png/420px-Kaelth%27s_Touch.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"276\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Kaelth%27s_Touch.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><i>This symbol once belonged to a Kaelth, a young warrior of the silver flame. This item is said to ward the bearer against harm.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<p><br />\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817045704\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.095 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.135 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2670/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 17505/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3954/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n120.28%  138.621     35 Template:IO\n100.00%  115.250      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  115.250      1 -total\n 96.50%  111.211      1 Template:Named_Jewelry\n 40.68%   46.888      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 39.65%   45.694      2 Template:IsLamannia